{"availability":"available","full":"DareDev256/portfolio-os","name":"portfolio-os","description":"A desktop operating system in a browser tab: draggable windows, GPU glass, a Three.js lock screen, a command palette and client-side routing. Vanilla JS, Vite as the only build step. Live demo.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-12-07T18:18:49Z","updated":"2026-10-08T15:31:43Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://portfolio-os-navy.vercel.app","topics":["canvas","cyberpunk","desktop-environment","javascript","portfolio","threejs","vanilla-js","vite","web-os","window-manager"],"demo":"https://jamesdare.com/os","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.146Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.146Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.146Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.146Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A fully interactive desktop environment — draggable windows, GPU-composited glass UI, Three.js cyberspace, Spotlight-style command palette — running entirely in the browser. No UI framework: the DOM is built by hand. The browser bundle carries one dependency, @vercel/analytics; the two serverless routes under api/ use @anthropic-ai/sdk.","Built by James Olusoga — AI Solutions Engineer & Creative Technologist, Toronto.","Every number below is reproducible from a clean clone. No figure in this README is typed by hand."],"features":["perspective(600px) — Close enough to create visible depth without fisheye distortion. Values below 400px warp aggressively; above 800px the tilt becomes imperceptible.","will-change: transform — Promotes the element to its own compositor layer. The GPU handles the 3D transform instead of triggering layout/paint cycles.","ease-out transition on transform — The icon follows the cursor with slight inertia on the way in, then springs back smoothly on mouseleave when all properties reset to defaults.","MutationObserver — Auto-wires icons added dynamically to the DOM, so no manual re-init is needed when the desktop grid changes."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DareDev256/portfolio-os/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2973a479839729d0834a535e5eceaded460d051940ca915d60fd543a69c784d3","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.388Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.388Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A fully interactive desktop environment — draggable windows, GPU-composited glass UI, Three.js cyberspace, Spotlight-style command palette — running entirely in the browser. No UI framework: the DOM is built by hand. The browser bundle carries one dependency, @vercel/analytics; the two serverless routes under api/ use @anthropic-ai/sdk.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DareDev256/portfolio-os/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Focus trapping in modals, lightbox, login, welcome, and tour overlays","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DareDev256/portfolio-os/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2973a479839729d0834a535e5eceaded460d051940ca915d60fd543a69c784d3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DareDev256/portfolio-os/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.389Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T15:31:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DareDev256/portfolio-os/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.391Z","hash":"2973a479839729d0834a535e5eceaded460d051940ca915d60fd543a69c784d3","originalBytes":46663,"storedBytes":46663,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["window","gold","tests","prefers-reduced-motion","amethyst","css","desktop","respects","cursor","via","system","api","screen","icons","icon","project","across","ambient","before","npm","reveal","vercel","animation","live","tilt","zero","data","docs","focus","glow","light","mutationobserver","when","code","custom","fps","glass","hover","lock"